#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/bluetooth/aioble/concurrency.rst:163
msgid "Wake."
msgstr "깨어납니다."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/bluetooth/aioble/concurrency.rst:164
msgid "As a central, read fresh values from a paired sensor strap."
msgstr "central로서 페어링된 센서 스트랩에서 새로운 값을 읽습니다."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/bluetooth/aioble/concurrency.rst:166
msgid ""
"As a peripheral, advertise for a phone to download the day's measurements."
msgstr "peripheral로서 휴대폰이 그날의 측정값을 다운로드하도록 광고합니다."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/bluetooth/aioble/concurrency.rst:168
msgid "When both are idle, call :func:`aioble.stop` and sleep."
msgstr "둘 다 유휴 상태일 때 :func:`aioble.stop` 을 호출하고 절전 모드로 들어갑니다."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/bluetooth/aioble/concurrency.rst:171
msgid ""
"The sequencing is straightforward with two tasks and an "
